  "page": 13,
  "citation": "Panel B of Table 3 shows that many of the top 1% strategies are quite far from the predictors noted in the academic literature.",
  "sha256_pdf_recalcule": "d338d13e08302df0f5d38c8886449eebe30ebd1a20d29390757658644ec50b7e",
  "empreinte_conforme": true,
